好。","text":"    红在双方布成列手炮后，积极出动左翼子力，而黑接走右直车被红炮八进四先手封车，殊不合算，应先走车9平8较好。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"0:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"    红右车抢占肋线要道后，双方子力出动的速度及所处的位置成鲜明的对比，红布局获得较大的成功。","text":"    红右车抢占肋线要道后，双方子力出动的速度及所处的位置成鲜明的对比，红布局获得较大的成功。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":"    红兑马简明，以下炮镇中路，再兑一车，红已控制全局。","text":"    红兑马简明，以下炮镇中路，再兑一车，红已控制全局。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment34:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment34","raw_text":"    红方两着挺兵不容忽视，一为预留马位，一为确保中炮的位置。","text":"    红方两着挺兵不容忽视，一为预留马位，一为确保中炮的位置。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":34,"anchor_node_id":"0:34","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":"    黑方车7进1速败之着，但如改走马7进5兑炮，再弃3卒打通车路，亦属败势。||    如图形势，红炮五平八绝妙，以下演变成排局式的借炮使马杀着。","text":"    黑方车7进1速败之着，但如改走马7进5兑炮，再弃3卒打通车路，亦属败势。\n    如图形势，红炮五平八绝妙，以下演变成排局式的借炮使马杀着。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":"    红胜。||","text":"    红胜。\n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["075广州杨官麟 先胜 西安张增华"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D50 中炮对列炮"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":14,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side